Composery: put "Connect Over SSH" in the File menu.

The command itself is a builtin extension (overlay/lib/vscode/extensions/
composery-ssh). An extension cannot reach the menubar - MenuId.MenubarHomeMenu
is internal - so the entry has to be registered here, beside the one the API
keys command already has.

Its own patch rather than a hunk added to api.diff: SSH is not the automation
API, and a patch is named for the concern it carries.

--- a/lib/vscode/src/vs/workbench/browser/client.ts
+++ b/lib/vscode/src/vs/workbench/browser/client.ts
@@ -117,6 +117,14 @@
 			},
 		});
 
+		// Composery: the command is implemented by the composery-ssh builtin extension.
+		MenuRegistry.appendMenuItem(MenuId.MenubarHomeMenu, {
+			command: {
+				id: 'composery.connectOverSsh',
+				title: localize('connectOverSsh', "Connect Over SSH"),
+			},
+		});
+
 		this.addShowQrCommand();
 		this.reloadOnBackForwardRestore();
 
